{"time": 1760894443, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1379030109", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=28075903]她穿着一身褐色上衣和深青色长裤，骨架不大，没比你高多少，似乎还带着些青春的活力，右手挎着一个麻布袋子“走吧走吧，还要看看有没有好点的琉璃，你爸爸的镜片有些糊了”"}
{"time": 1760894478, "type": "recv", "message_id": "584400078", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1879533109]（我会说会碰上的.jpg）"}
{"time": 1760894485, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1015427091", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（好的）"}
{"time": 1760894557, "type": "recv", "message_id": "500535531", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1379030109]总之，你和母亲到了的时候发现马车旁边还排着十几个人的队。此外还有一个有些单薄的身影"}
{"time": 1760894565, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1998208134", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"好，都听妈的。\"走到她身边自然地搂着她的手臂，\"不过要是看到什么好看的小玩意，妈能不能给我也买一点啦。\""}
{"time": 1760894640, "type": "recv", "message_id": "50638227", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1879533109]（练你最喜欢的魔法飞弹？）"}
{"time": 1760894651, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1172532224", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "正准备离开的时候看见了舒茉，“阿姨，舒茉，早上好啊，你们也来买东西吗”"}
{"time": 1760894664, "type": "recv", "message_id": "727216981", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=50638227]（是啊，我要去测量我的dps）"}
{"time": 1760894687, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1595243957", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（舒茉平时做什么.jpg）"}
{"time": 1760894708, "type": "recv", "message_id": "923214798", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1172532224]松开搂着的手臂，招招手，笑容满面，\"伊恩！嗯嗯，来买东西。\""}
{"time": 1760894718, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2056726870", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(学木匠活吧)"}
{"time": 1760894758, "type": "recv", "message_id": "447665985", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(看镇上的藏书，学木工，跟着伊恩鬼混)"}
{"time": 1760894784, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1261363991", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“等下我来帮你们拿吧”自告奋勇的提出要帮忙"}
{"time": 1760894831, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1762030369", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"好难得的哦，不好好看看有什么可不行。\"叉着腰，\"伊恩听我指挥啦。\""}
{"time": 1760894878, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1814339850", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1998208134]“要买那种好看的小玩意，要等公国那边过来的车队才对……不过舒茉也快到要打扮的年纪了？”她摸摸你的脑袋，然后也看到了伊恩，索性放你们两个自己去玩，她排到队伍末尾去了"}
{"time": 1760894885, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1541895813", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯，都听舒茉的”"}
