{"time": 1760964553, "type": "recv", "message_id": "629203923", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1267567154]先透过门缝看一下是谁"}
{"time": 1760964647, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1696614670", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "舒服地躺在床上，早上其实自己就不怎么想醒，现在倒是刚刚好"}
{"time": 1760964698, "type": "recv", "message_id": "837241163", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1267567154]自然是舒茉的母亲。手里捧着两个盒子“呀，伊恩怎么一个人在这。不是说去木料场练习的吗？”"}
{"time": 1760964932, "type": "recv", "message_id": "650357772", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"真是的...明明自己都这么做了。\"小声自言自语，\"真..是...\"自己是不是有点像在睡回笼觉?胡思乱想的时候睡着了。"}
{"time": 1760964937, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1581131761", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“舒茉有一点点不舒服，我已经带她去看过医生了，虽然没什么大碍，不过我觉得还是让她多休息一下比较好，就带她回家了，本来我准备照顾一下她，不过阿姨回来了，好像暂时用不到我了，那我就先走了？”"}
{"time": 1760965083, "type": "recv", "message_id": "940893712", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“噢，她怎么了？今天早上起床的时候还好好的，谢谢你了。”她睁大了点眼睛，换好拖鞋进门“你没什么安排的话，在这里等午饭也可以”"}
{"time": 1760965211, "type": "recv", "message_id": "106609885", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我也不太清楚，医生好像说是舒茉最近心情不太好导致的？”摇摇头“至于午饭，那谢谢阿姨了”"}
{"time": 1760965285, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1154283182", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯，现在要不要吃点水果？”她这么问着，不过先往舒茉的房间走去"}
{"time": 1760965333, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1101168646", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不用了，谢谢阿姨”"}
{"time": 1760965388, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1428526521", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "一如既往，她轻轻敲了敲门。除非被拒绝，她都会先把门开一个小缝"}
{"time": 1760965410, "type": "recv", "message_id": "68889021", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "睡着了的现在当然没回答"}
{"time": 1760965411, "type": "recv", "message_id": "25419074", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=650357772]（睡着还挺快）"}
{"time": 1760965478, "type": "recv", "message_id": "418081641", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(过了一会了吧)"}
{"time": 1760965541, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1757441133", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "她很快又把门轻轻带上“睡着了……哎，吃饭的时候自己会醒的。”"}
{"time": 1760965554, "type": "recv", "message_id": "130865333", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（然后你要继续在客厅cos玩偶吗）"}
{"time": 1760965573, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1340560419", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（那我也没其他的事干了吗）"}
{"time": 1760965579, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1560908384", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "看看客厅有没有什么书看"}
{"time": 1760965715, "type": "recv", "message_id": "46135647", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "确实有个书柜，不过除了技术手册，就是些上了年纪的人容易喜欢的史书和建筑学图册"}
{"time": 1760965745, "type": "recv", "message_id": "523808022", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "征求阿姨的同意之后，拿起史书看看吧"}
