{"time": 1760969374, "type": "recv", "message_id": "776812810", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2133232298]“中午做了汉堡排哦”她摸摸你的额头，“还有黄油焗面包……记得多喝水”"}
{"time": 1760969511, "type": "recv", "message_id": "858516627", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...妈妈最好了。\"跟在她身后进了客厅，\"伊恩也一起吃吧?\"脑袋蹭蹭母亲的肩膀"}
{"time": 1760969683, "type": "recv", "message_id": "816866904", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "已经在餐桌前了“啊？嗯..中午好啊，舒茉，感觉好点了”"}
{"time": 1760969683, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1616236467", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=858516627]“也要记得好好感谢爸爸哦”她摸摸你的脑袋“我们能有这样的生活都是靠他在努力……我做了伊恩的份的”"}
{"time": 1760969688, "type": "recv", "message_id": "161174345", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=816866904]“吗”"}
{"time": 1760969777, "type": "recv", "message_id": "958470090", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"当然啦。\"舒服地眯着眼睛，\"晚上再好好感谢爸爸。\"吐吐舌头，\"好多了，不过今天果然不怎么想动呢...\""}
{"time": 1760970035, "type": "recv", "message_id": "61427555", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“是不是在家里闷久了？哎……虽然担心你们玩起来会跑远，但是一直待在家里也不太好呢……”"}
{"time": 1760970077, "type": "recv", "message_id": "274585775", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“要不下午我带舒茉去晒晒太阳吧”"}
