{"time": 1760979597, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1244109981", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（哦他在热水）"}
{"time": 1760981253, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1583048802", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=834364082]“林子里的话，找个……算了。”她摇摇头“晚饭之前一定要回来”"}
{"time": 1760981541, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1382431708", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=480064373]\"好诶。\"抱着妈妈手臂摇一摇，随后看向伊恩，\"伊恩的话，保护我肯定不成问题吧？不过也不能进太深的地方啦...就在靠近城镇的地方...\""}
{"time": 1760983501, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1452979120", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（）"}
