{"time": 1760987185, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1149251976", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"果然得看一看小花小草什么的，放心好了，我跟得上。\"扭头四处看看，有没有值得注意的新奇玩意"}
{"time": 1760987213, "type": "recv", "message_id": "397676388", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我也不知道哪个方向啊）"}
