{"time": 1760987787, "type": "recv", "message_id": "6397497", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "说起来似乎营养价值也不错，好像能做成hp药水？虽然是最普通的那种"}
