{"time": 1761018551, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1534810025", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好了，我们继续走吧”去看医生"}
{"time": 1761020331, "type": "recv", "message_id": "346541214", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1534810025]\"嗯。\"安心地牵着手，走在前面一点，好掩饰自己的表情，\"走快点啦。\""}
{"time": 1761020433, "type": "recv", "message_id": "840167097", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "路上倒是有镇民注意到了你们，有些熟识的凑了上来“哎呦，这是怎么了？怎么这么多血？怎么搞的？”"}
{"time": 1761020613, "type": "recv", "message_id": "499932278", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "簇簇拥拥的，不过看起来是在帮你们开路的样子"}
{"time": 1761020684, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1189699433", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"在林子里...\"其实完全不记得到底发生了什么，\"嗯...\"不知道说什么，回头看着伊恩。"}
{"time": 1761021055, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1414966346", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“在林子里不小心剐蹭到了...”"}
{"time": 1761021143, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1774810770", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“让医生看看吧，万一是什么有毒的植物就不好了……舒茉看起来没事？我先去找阿姨吧”*一个看起来比你们大一两岁的姐姐说到，转身欲走"}
{"time": 1761021233, "type": "recv", "message_id": "85161872", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"妈妈...\"想到妈妈的叮嘱身体一缩，\"嗯...\"回答有些犹豫，\"麻烦姐姐了。\""}
{"time": 1761021311, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1664655256", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“谢谢姐姐..”"}
{"time": 1761021324, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2060018070", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "总之对方离开了，看热闹的看伊恩好像也没什么大事，甚至脸色都还健康，也就回去忙自己的了。最后留下那么两三个把你们送到了医院门口"}
{"time": 1761021344, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1056089052", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "(吃个饭)"}
