{"time": 1761034309, "type": "recv", "message_id": "531206927", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我现在右肩膀痛都感觉好不舒服，哎）"}
{"time": 1761034324, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1845265789", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那个舒茉...是不是松开比较合适....”看着仍然牵起来的手"}
{"time": 1761034388, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1895241261", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“外衣脱掉”她开口，准备好消毒药品"}
{"time": 1761034459, "type": "recv", "message_id": "353347086", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯...”有些恋恋不舍的松开手，然后脱掉外衣“嘶...”外套蹭到伤口果然还是很痛"}
{"time": 1761034467, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2010270000", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（[CQ:at,qq=1252219916] ）"}
{"time": 1761034568, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1171592551", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（[CQ:at,qq=1252219916] ）"}
{"time": 1761034997, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1598960670", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "手臂上被划出的小口子已经结痂，肩膀上的没有那么快，只是血浆比较粘稠。她拿着个装着药的小瓶子，小指指了指桌上的一个草莓大小的一个小瓶子，“先闻闻那个”"}
{"time": 1761035036, "type": "recv", "message_id": "995500812", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“这是什么”但听话的凑过去闻闻"}
{"time": 1761035201, "type": "recv", "message_id": "903918361", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "1(醒了)"}
{"time": 1761035348, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1298838968", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=903918361]（那你动）"}
{"time": 1761035418, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1473225011", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "瓶子没有常见的那种盖子，而是类似网筛。里头似乎是些粉末，你闻到一股海腥和果香夹杂的气味，完全不和谐。按理说不该带给你平和的感觉，但是你闻完却觉得有些迟钝。医生顺势把药液淋在你的创面。你觉得有些微刺痛“好经典的齿痕……这是猫妖干的吧。”"}
{"time": 1761035456, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1565465214", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“猫妖吗....我不太记得了”"}
{"time": 1761035488, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1506206148", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1473225011]（麻药吗？）"}
{"time": 1761035497, "type": "recv", "message_id": "891347474", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（差不多）"}
{"time": 1761035500, "type": "recv", "message_id": "251437710", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "想要抬起手挠挠头，却没什么力气"}
{"time": 1761036012, "type": "recv", "message_id": "433784554", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（伊酱又睡着了？）"}
{"time": 1761036019, "type": "recv", "message_id": "14348329", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"猫妖?\"瞪大眼睛"}
{"time": 1761036066, "type": "recv", "message_id": "480744667", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我完全没有印象...神官姐姐...我是怎么了...\"语气惊慌"}
{"time": 1761036116, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1413598778", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1565465214]“不记得了？”她皱了皱眉“好吧，也不是第一次见。”\n叶梦牧师把右手放在书皮上嵌着的金属十字上，左手抬起，这次从掌心里亮起的是绿色的光芒"}
{"time": 1761036356, "type": "recv", "message_id": "806881406", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"眉头皱在一起，带着些担忧，顺从地等待神官小姐的施法。"}
{"time": 1761036463, "type": "recv", "message_id": "786373074", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不是什么少见的情况，你就当是一种……人体的保护机制吧。受到刺激的时候，大脑会选择性封存一部分记忆”医生收好药，开始准备绷带。在牧师的施法下，伊恩的伤口肉眼可见地结痂起来。"}
{"time": 1761036533, "type": "recv", "message_id": "386404937", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“这样吗...”但是两个人同时失忆还是感觉好奇怪啊"}
{"time": 1761036561, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1778467281", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“谢谢两位姐姐，好厉害”看着快速愈合的伤口感觉好神奇"}
{"time": 1761037043, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1932513688", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"感觉还是很奇怪，但是这个时候...\"嗯嗯，谢谢姐姐。\""}
{"time": 1761037083, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2051187683", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我应该做的……”牧师小姐露出关切的笑容“没有伤到骨头，不过痊愈还是要些时间。啊……对了，你们还记得在哪里受伤的吗？”"}
{"time": 1761037167, "type": "recv", "message_id": "744070394", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"从村子旁边的...林子里出来...就成了现在这样...如果是怪物的话...\"低着脑袋，\"伊恩肯定是...保护我...\"自责涌上来，哽住了"}
{"time": 1761037170, "type": "recv", "message_id": "285234858", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“就在东边的林子吧...”"}
{"time": 1761037241, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1494806665", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“真的不怪你啦，舒茉，而且本来就是我提议要去的，再说我不也没什么事么”"}
{"time": 1761037358, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2108817113", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我要问你妈妈叫什么了）"}
{"time": 1761037470, "type": "recv", "message_id": "809364248", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我想想)"}
{"time": 1761037478, "type": "recv", "message_id": "253692344", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(舒蕾吧)"}
{"time": 1761037485, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1913082201", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(既然这么起名的话)"}
{"time": 1761037567, "type": "recv", "message_id": "466824033", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（听起来能吃）"}
{"time": 1761037576, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2120127817", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（听起来像姐妹）"}
{"time": 1761037622, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2144602151", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "看起来医生对这种戏码不太感兴趣，已经开始缠绷带了。牧师刚想开口安慰，目光却越过你看向门口“啊，舒蕾小姐。不用担心，没什么问题的”"}
{"time": 1761037984, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1020211463", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "僵硬地回过头，其实有些说不上的害怕，\"妈妈...?\""}
{"time": 1761038003, "type": "recv", "message_id": "541575824", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "顺着目光看过去“阿姨...对不起，我不该带舒茉去那么危险的地方”"}
{"time": 1761038036, "type": "recv", "message_id": "838382924", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（危险在哪（）"}
{"time": 1761038156, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1994030799", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（危险在受伤了）"}
{"time": 1761038192, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1388173152", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（小概率事件不代表那是危险的地方（））"}
{"time": 1761038207, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1337326658", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你应该问前线的人怎么漏怪了）"}
{"time": 1761038415, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2121257158", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(他失忆了的话，不记得具体说危险可能也对吧)"}
{"time": 1761038512, "type": "recv", "message_id": "145304466", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1020211463]“舒茉伊恩，你们……”她有些喘，快步来到你们背后，用力地抱住了你，搂住你的肩膀“呼……谢谢两位……别怕别怕，已经没事了。怎么回事？伊恩怎么受这么重的伤了？”*听起来倒是没什么问责的意思"}
{"time": 1761038635, "type": "recv", "message_id": "939251814", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我记得不太清了..不过其实还好啦，虽然看着很疼..”"}
{"time": 1761038825, "type": "recv", "message_id": "301160780", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“看起来像有猫妖钻过了防线，他们说是在东边的林子里受的伤”*医生补充解释，站了起来“我去报告给村长。他们应该是惊吓过度……暂时不要问太多比较好”"}
{"time": 1761038878, "type": "recv", "message_id": "65587734", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"姐姐说是猫妖...但是舒茉一点都不记得...\"用力抱住妈妈，心下当即安心下来，身体放松依偎在她的怀里，\"妈...\""}
{"time": 1761039155, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1993899553", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=541575824]“没事，附近本来应该很安全的，不怪你……舒茉也好好地回来了”舒蕾轻轻拍着舒茉的后背，转过脸来宽慰你"}
{"time": 1761039237, "type": "recv", "message_id": "288881834", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "这个时候也不知道该说什么，把身体交给本能，紧紧依缩在母亲的怀里。"}
{"time": 1761039296, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1181252329", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“谢谢阿姨...”"}
{"time": 1761039630, "type": "recv", "message_id": "361794969", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“啊……处理好了的话我就先带他们回去了。有什么要注意的吗？啊还有，多少钱？”舒蕾从怀里摸出一个小荷包"}
{"time": 1761039716, "type": "recv", "message_id": "987798552", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我来付就好了..今天已经麻烦阿姨的够多了”"}
{"time": 1761039947, "type": "recv", "message_id": "375325611", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“那个……不用……哎”牧师讪笑着开口又改口“应该是35银币……”"}
{"time": 1761039981, "type": "recv", "message_id": "717346694", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"现在也不太能耍性子，也没有那份力气，把脑袋凑到母亲肩膀上耷拉着。"}
{"time": 1761040110, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1207487182", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=987798552]显然舒蕾起手比你更快，很快理出银币交给牧师“好了好了，这有什么好说的。你就是太不懂接受人家的心意。”她看了你一眼，“走吧走吧”"}
{"time": 1761040213, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1795277881", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "附和着母亲的话嗯了一声，\"伊恩要跟上呢...\"搂着母亲的手臂靠在她的肩膀上跟着走"}
{"time": 1761040459, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2065637051", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "感觉舒蕾好像在暗示什么，不太懂“谢谢阿姨”然后起身，感觉腿好像有点软“舒茉...可以..可以扶我走..一段吗”有些扭捏"}
{"time": 1761040673, "type": "recv", "message_id": "251996690", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（又幻想了？）"}
