{"time": 1761050953, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1604275077", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=477055926]没什么你插手的余地，何况你现在还是“伤员”"}
{"time": 1761051092, "type": "recv", "message_id": "829546862", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "一时不知道该怎么办，只能坐回到沙发上，试图和舒茉父亲聊聊天“叔叔...我今天看了看您的史书，感觉蛮有意思的”"}
{"time": 1761051281, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1121262322", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=829546862]“嗯，挺好的，年轻人是该多看看……”他看起来不比你自在多少，说到一半又刹住了，换了个话题“呃，你伤口好些了吗？”"}
{"time": 1761051337, "type": "recv", "message_id": "125577167", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯..医生姐姐和神官姐姐很厉害，伤口已经不怎么疼了”"}
{"time": 1761051349, "type": "recv", "message_id": "348929813", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（为什么要换话题，我还想问他为什么没有下册呢（））"}
{"time": 1761051364, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1858513481", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（因为他可能发现你平时没书能看（）"}
{"time": 1761051412, "type": "recv", "message_id": "720437589", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=348929813]（你没发现是kp层面没有下册吗）"}
{"time": 1761051442, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1723653394", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（hh,我只是想看看kp会怎么回答）"}
{"time": 1761051484, "type": "recv", "message_id": "22207253", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=125577167]“喔，那就好”然后空气又回到诡异的安静。大概他真的不擅长聊天"}
{"time": 1761051557, "type": "recv", "message_id": "625952537", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（该出来了，伊）"}
{"time": 1761051575, "type": "recv", "message_id": "64040876", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "出门，jpg"}
{"time": 1761051643, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1871582575", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "空气重新流动起来，这客厅看起来终于是活人呆的了"}
{"time": 1761051686, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2044365290", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "头发湿漉漉的，没怎么擦，被简单包起来，\"诶...?怎么都没说话？\"看上去又恢复了活力满满的样子"}
{"time": 1761051814, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2078725566", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不知道说什么……欢迎？”*他摇了摇头，叹了口气“不过看你们都没什么事，挺好的”"}
{"time": 1761051836, "type": "recv", "message_id": "180989293", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯...谢谢叔叔关心”"}
{"time": 1761051916, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2032708090", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"有什么啦？\"坐到父亲身边，解开包着头发的毛巾，\"爸爸，今天妈妈让我感谢你呢？\"笑眯眯地"}
{"time": 1761052060, "type": "recv", "message_id": "513548299", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯，一会多吃点……”这大概是他能说出最客套的话“谢我？怎么了，我没帮上什么……”"}
{"time": 1761052113, "type": "recv", "message_id": "792260384", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嘻嘻，那你待会去问妈妈啦。\"甩甩脑袋，把毛巾递到爸爸手里，\"爸～帮我擦干头发啦。\""}
{"time": 1761053125, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1910611567", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“哦好”*他接过毛巾坐到你旁边，例行公事一般帮你擦干头发。双手一如既往地有力"}
{"time": 1761053585, "type": "recv", "message_id": "170501585", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"今晚吃什么?\"开口询问，享受着这种感觉，看向伊恩，\"伊恩晚上也在我家里吃饭吧?\""}
{"time": 1761053879, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1967210206", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯...好啊，这件事不是早上的时候都已经说好了吗”"}
{"time": 1761055062, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2082100494", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1967210206]\"我再确认一下啦。\"对着他笑，看上去很有朝气，\"要好好吃饱哦今天。\""}
{"time": 1761055191, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1783030169", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "长茧的双手收起毛巾，随后直接摸了摸你的脑袋“嗯……好了，你们玩吧，我去端菜”"}
{"time": 1761055440, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1341076900", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯，我不会客气的...”看着舒茉精神的样子有些恍惚"}
{"time": 1761055999, "type": "recv", "message_id": "958738683", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "笑着看着伊恩，\"怎么了?突然有些发呆。\"在他面前挥挥自己的右手，\"真是的，在我面前坐着还能发呆，是不是在想不好的事情?\""}
{"time": 1761056028, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1527633918", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我能想什么不好的事情呢？”"}
{"time": 1761056145, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1439523075", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“只是感觉白天的事情好像梦一样不真实...”"}
{"time": 1761056747, "type": "recv", "message_id": "823296080", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1439523075]\"我怎么会知道?\"收回手，\"嘛，不过想一想我也不会介意哦?\"抱着手臂，笑得很轻，有些扭捏。"}
