{"time": 1761063371, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1415517920", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我也很期待..”小声说道，和舒茉一起，做什么都很开心，虽然吃饭本身就是一件很开心的事，当然后半句只是在心里想想"}
{"time": 1761063717, "type": "recv", "message_id": "447343414", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（？[CQ:at,qq=825734198] [CQ:at,qq=1252219916] ）"}
{"time": 1761063769, "type": "recv", "message_id": "667373411", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(打字)"}
{"time": 1761063775, "type": "recv", "message_id": "629540952", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（好的）"}
{"time": 1761064037, "type": "recv", "message_id": "415684816", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1415517920]\"说起来...伊恩喜欢吃什么东西?\""}
{"time": 1761064129, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1687737395", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“除了内脏，我基本都能吃...不过有吃的我已经很满足了”"}
{"time": 1761064246, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1086117307", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你知道的）"}
{"time": 1761064248, "type": "recv", "message_id": "249210099", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我在跑刀）"}
{"time": 1761064258, "type": "recv", "message_id": "547566004", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诶...\"站起身，\"那可不行。"}
{"time": 1761064302, "type": "recv", "message_id": "991634939", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"挑食不是好孩子，下次我带你去镇上的餐馆里，专挑一些内脏。\"扬起笑脸，\"哼哼...\""}
{"time": 1761064432, "type": "recv", "message_id": "681774135", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哎？...谢...谢”咬着牙，硬挤出笑容说出了这句话"}
{"time": 1761064449, "type": "recv", "message_id": "568284950", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那舒茉呢，舒茉喜欢吃什么”"}
{"time": 1761064655, "type": "recv", "message_id": "445197817", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "在他面前转个身，\"我的话，没什么特别讨厌的...\""}
{"time": 1761064728, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1766756978", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"相信我哦?\"俯下身看向伊恩，眨一眨双眼"}
{"time": 1761064753, "type": "recv", "message_id": "302788359", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“真的吗？等会我问问叔叔阿姨去”"}
{"time": 1761064972, "type": "recv", "message_id": "963386302", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诶，好吧...\"咬咬嘴唇，撇撇嘴\"舒茉不喜欢吃一些味道很冲的东西...\""}
{"time": 1761065010, "type": "recv", "message_id": "773327734", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那舒茉不觉得内脏味道很冲吗”"}
{"time": 1761065304, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1661669723", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"如果处理地很好的话，内脏的味道其实也还好啦。伊恩是出于什么理由不想吃内脏的?\"有些好奇，重新坐下来，坐到他旁边，双手交叠放在裙子上"}
{"time": 1761065405, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1570283534", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“单纯的不喜欢那个味道吧...也或者是因为失忆前的事情？不知道啦”摇摇头“不过虽然不喜欢吃，但让我吃的话还是可以吃下去的”"}
{"time": 1761065588, "type": "recv", "message_id": "645699772", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"好吧，如果伊恩不想吃的话，我也不会强迫你吃的啦。\"放松地躺在沙发的靠背上，蔚蓝色的长发散落了一沙发，\"嘛，果然还是...吃喜欢吃的东西，会更幸福吧。\""}
{"time": 1761065641, "type": "recv", "message_id": "18420865", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“如果是和舒茉一起吃的话...”小声嘀咕，后半句就藏在心里了"}
{"time": 1761065785, "type": "recv", "message_id": "974577601", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（有这么，关系好吗（）"}
{"time": 1761065929, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1838249298", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（本身关系就不错吧）"}
{"time": 1761065936, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1245140244", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诶?伊恩在说什么?\"靠近一点，手放在耳朵边招一招"}
{"time": 1761065968, "type": "recv", "message_id": "246534503", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“没什么啦..”摆摆手“舒茉听错了吧”"}
{"time": 1761066311, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2137232134", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=246534503]\"诶?\"那就拉远一点距离，语气变得有些低，\"我其实...想起了一点点\""}
{"time": 1761066451, "type": "recv", "message_id": "286622555", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“是吗...不过肯定是不怎么愉快的记忆吧，只要你没事，剩下的事我都不在意的...”"}
{"time": 1761066713, "type": "recv", "message_id": "515236896", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=286622555]\"嗯...我们被猫妖袭击，然后伊恩保护了我...呼...我果然是拖后腿的。\"低着头，抓着自己大腿上的裙子布料，\"伊恩很厉害，迟早会离开这里的。\""}
{"time": 1761066807, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1968572572", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“舒茉才不是拖后腿的，而且....我...不想离开...”"}
{"time": 1761067054, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2083454265", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1968572572]\"我当时，被吓得不能动弹...跪在地上...只能眼睁睁看着伊恩保护我而受伤...\"攥得更紧，\"伊恩...你不是想不想，你必须要离开...在这里，是没有未来的。\""}
{"time": 1761067068, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1542860850", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“能保护舒茉...我很开心”站起来蹲在她面前，抬头看向舒茉"}
{"time": 1761067157, "type": "recv", "message_id": "585558332", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“未来什么的...好遥远，我不想去想，而当下，我还不想离开..我想留下来”"}
{"time": 1761067566, "type": "recv", "message_id": "378360668", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "就在这时，厨房的门开了。家主端着两个碗先一步走出"}
{"time": 1761067590, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1513886044", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "急忙站起身来"}
{"time": 1761067592, "type": "recv", "message_id": "976612996", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=585558332]\"...\"沉默了一会，\"不行...如果你说什么放弃自己的前途和未来...这种事...我绝对不会原谅你。\"深吸一口气，\"伊恩的资质...绝对不可能是留在这里的人，我是如此相信...所以，我不允许。\"语气倒是平缓，说的声音不高。"}
{"time": 1761067841, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1647359470", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好了，先吃饭吧，等会再聊”"}
{"time": 1761067890, "type": "recv", "message_id": "402121130", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“哦……在说什么呢？”*他盯着这边看了一小会，随后在“杵在这干什么呢”的声音中挪到餐桌旁。今晚的主食是烤土豆，正餐是中午汉堡肉排的肉汁焗鱼排和通菜梗。荤素搭配的同时营养丰富"}
{"time": 1761068043, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1722070951", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"没什么啦，谈一下未来要做什么。\"笑着走到桌边坐下，\"舒茉都十六岁了，爸爸怎么一点不着急。\""}
{"time": 1761068085, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1204709996", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "也跟着过去坐下"}
{"time": 1761068229, "type": "recv", "message_id": "22135558", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“这种事情急也没用的嘛，总要有个契机”他用餐刀把带皮的土豆切开一个十字，在上面浇上些肉汁，放到你们面前“你们还没找到喜欢的东西吧”"}
{"time": 1761068256, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1567430802", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“谢谢叔叔...”"}
{"time": 1761068359, "type": "recv", "message_id": "614624616", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "喜欢的东西吗...自己喜欢什么呢，轻轻扭头不经意间看向舒茉，急忙扭回头盯着土豆，自己在想什么呢...只是朋友啦，朋友..."}
{"time": 1761068469, "type": "recv", "message_id": "358477025", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...硬要说的话...\"拿着叉子思考，开口，\"舒茉留在家里帮衬生意就好了。\""}
{"time": 1761068681, "type": "recv", "message_id": "104550552", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“呀，我们可没有催你”舒蕾无奈笑笑“慢慢考虑吧，人生比你们想象的长的多”"}
{"time": 1761068835, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1242489086", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（人生是旷野）"}
{"time": 1761068902, "type": "recv", "message_id": "859426328", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“阿姨说的对，以后的事还是以后考虑吧”"}
{"time": 1761068939, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1629245125", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"妈妈老是这么说。\"叉出土豆咬一口，\"但我舒茉又没什么特殊的地方...以后能像妈妈这样就很满意了。\"被土豆烫到了，卷卷舌头吹气"}
{"time": 1761069024, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1610094583", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我在想你知不知道自己是孤儿（）"}
{"time": 1761069101, "type": "recv", "message_id": "681844911", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“每个人都是特殊的啦....”小小咬一口软糯的土豆，面面的，好好吃，但还是慢慢的吃，害怕烫到"}
{"time": 1761069289, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1606437077", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我吗？)"}
{"time": 1761069295, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1486065657", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我肯定不知道啊)"}
{"time": 1761069328, "type": "recv", "message_id": "617702779", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你对你的发色没有什么猜想吗（）"}
{"time": 1761069344, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1542419753", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(肯定不会下意识往这个方向想)"}
{"time": 1761069405, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1870666208", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（什么时候能出门冒险，龙哥）"}
{"time": 1761069408, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1958217326", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（感觉好平淡，是不是该发生点什么）"}
{"time": 1761069421, "type": "recv", "message_id": "601313828", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你们一个个都不想出去的样子（）"}
{"time": 1761069434, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1522113791", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "对伊恩的话不置可否，\"舒茉就是普通女孩啦，就这样一直待在这里。妈妈难道不愿意吗？真是的...\""}
